{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>לרצנכם תמים זכר.</b> Above, in the pericope of ויקרא, it dealt with obligatory offerings, and here with vows and freewill offerings. There it did not specify the blemishes, and here it specified them. But let our Sages ask: why is 'other offerings' stated here?"], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:14:20.932057148Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}